# Generated API artifacts are byte-compared by the `check:api-types` drift gate, which
# runs on a Windows CI runner. Pin them to LF so a runner with core.autocrlf=true can't
# produce a spurious CRLF-vs-LF diff and fail the gate on a no-op.
apps/api/openapi.json text eol=lf
apps/web/src/lib/api/schema.d.ts text eol=lf
